{"ts": "2026-09-28 12:51:01", "level": "DEBUG", "event": "llm.context_sent", "status": "success", "chunks": [{"parent_id": "731ab1ba-6d00-4e65-b1c9-984b662e8ddc", "text": "AquaFlow AF-200 Submersible Pump\nUser Manual & Technical Reference\nThis manual covers installation, operation, maintenance, troubleshooting, and warranty terms for the\nAquaFlow AF-200 submersible water pump."}, {"parent_id": "06f1604a-84d6-44ca-bec8-e380d36beabb", "text": "1. Warranty Information\nThe AquaFlow AF-200 is covered by a limited warranty period of 12 months from the date of purchase.\nThis warranty covers defects in materials and workmanship under normal use.\nThe warranty does not cover damage caused by improper installation, unauthorized repairs, or use with\nfluids other than clean fresh water. To make a warranty claim, contact AquaFlow customer support with\nyour original purchase receipt and the product serial number.\nExtended warranty coverage of up to 36 months is available for purchase separately within 90 days of\nthe original purchase date."}, {"parent_id": "e7345438-1a19-48bb-afff-eaba19426dc6", "text": "5. Technical Specifications\n Specification\nValue\nModel\nAquaFlow AF-200\nMax flow rate\n200 liters per minute\nMax head height\n8 meters\nPower rating\n750 watts\nVoltage\n230V AC, 50Hz\nCable length\n10 meters\nMax water temperature\n35 degrees Celsius\nHousing material\nStainless steel and reinforced polymer\nWeight\n6.2 kg"}, {"parent_id": "36b6e09a-0c0e-4ab5-b657-97f4c33d9f21", "text": "6. Safety Precautions\nAlways disconnect power before performing any maintenance or inspection. Do not touch the pump,\npower cable, or plug with wet hands. This product is not intended for use in swimming pools or with\nflammable liquids.\nKeep the pump out of reach of children. The AF-200 is not designed to be operated by persons with\nreduced physical or sensory capabilities without supervision."}], "request_id": "028b185c", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
