{"ts": "2026-09-28 12:51:08", "level": "INFO", "event": "chat.qa", "question": "yes", "answer": "**AquaFlow AF‑200 (Submersible Pump)**  \n- The AF‑200 is a submersible water pump designed for installation, operation, maintenance, troubleshooting, and warranty service.  \n- **Warranty:** Limited warranty of 12 months from purchase (covers defects in materials and workmanship under normal use). An extended warranty of up to 36 months can be bought separately within 90 days of the original purchase.  \n- **Technical specifications:**  \n  - Model: AquaFlow AF‑200  \n  - Max flow rate: 200 liters per minute  \n  - Max head height: 8 meters  \n  - Power rating: 750 watts  \n  - Voltage: 230 V AC, 50 Hz  \n  - Cable length: 10 meters  \n  - Max water temperature: 35 °C  \n  - Housing material: Stainless steel and reinforced polymer  \n  - Weight: 6.2 kg  \n- **Safety precautions:** Disconnect power before maintenance; do not touch pump, cable, or plug with wet hands; not for swimming pools or flammable liquids; keep out of reach of children; not for use by persons with reduced physical or sensory capabilities without supervision.\n\n**AquaFlow AF‑300 (Countertop Beverage Brewer)**  \n- The AF‑300 is a countertop beverage brewer with three brew modes and a removable 1.8‑liter reservoir.  \n- **Overview & operation:** Fill the reservoir, insert the filter, select a brew mode (Classic, Strong, Quick), and press Start. Quick mode is intended for smaller servings.  \n- **Maintenance:** Rinse the reusable stainless‑steel filter after each use; descale periodically when mineral buildup is visible or brewing performance declines.  \n- **Troubleshooting:** If brewing stops, check that the reservoir is seated correctly and contains sufficient water; if the unit does not heat, disconnect power and contact authorized service.  \n- **Warranty:** 24‑month limited warranty covering manufacturing defects under normal household use (consumable wear and misuse excluded).  \n- **Technical specifications:**  \n  - Model: AquaFlow AF‑300  \n  - Capacity: 1.8 liters  \n  - Heating range: 92–96 °C  \n  - Brew modes: Classic, Strong, Quick  \n  - Reservoir: 1.8 L removable tank  \n  - Filter: Reusable stainless‑steel mesh  \n  - Power: 1450 W  \n\nThese details are drawn directly from the AquaFlow AF‑200 and AF‑300 manuals in the indexed documents.", "sources": 5, "duration_ms": 39429, "budget": {"max_agent_iterations": 3, "max_llm_calls": 3, "max_retrieval_operations": 2, "max_guardrail_retries": 1, "agent_iterations": 1, "llm_calls": 3, "retrieval_operations": 1, "guardrail_retries": 0}, "request_id": "028b185c", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
