{"ts": "2026-09-28 12:51:45", "level": "INFO", "event": "chat.qa", "question": "compare the warranty for both", "answer": "**AquaFlow AF‑200 (Submersible Pump)**  \n- Standard limited warranty: **12 months** from the date of purchase.  \n- Covers defects in materials and workmanship under normal use.  \n- Does **not** cover damage from improper installation, unauthorized repairs, or use with fluids other than clean fresh water.  \n- An **extended warranty** of up to **36 months** can be purchased separately, but only within **90 days** of the original purchase.\n\n**AquaFlow AF‑300 (Countertop Beverage Brewer)**  \n- Limited warranty: **24 months** from the date of purchase.  \n- Covers manufacturing defects under normal household use.  \n- Consumable wear and misuse are **excluded** from coverage.  \n- No mention of an optional extended warranty in the provided excerpt.\n\n**Comparison**  \n- The AF‑300 offers a longer base warranty period (24 months) than the AF‑200 (12 months).  \n- Only the AF‑200 provides an option to purchase an extended warranty (up to 36 months total); the AF‑300 excerpt does not describe any extended warranty option.  \n- Both warranties cover defects in materials/workmanship (or manufacturing defects) under normal use and exclude damage from misuse or improper handling.", "sources": 4, "duration_ms": 33370, "budget": {"max_agent_iterations": 3, "max_llm_calls": 3, "max_retrieval_operations": 2, "max_guardrail_retries": 1, "agent_iterations": 1, "llm_calls": 3, "retrieval_operations": 1, "guardrail_retries": 0}, "request_id": "fbe080a8", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
