{"ts": "2026-09-28 12:52:51", "level": "INFO", "event": "chat.qa", "question": "yes", "answer": "**Warranty comparison (based on the indexed manuals)**  \n\n| Product | Base warranty length | What is covered | Key exclusions / notes |\n|---------|----------------------|----------------|------------------------|\n| **AquaFlow AF‑200** (submersible pump) | **12 months** from date of purchase | Defects in materials and workmanship under normal use | – Does not cover damage from improper installation, unauthorized repairs, or use with fluids other than clean fresh water.<br>– **Extended warranty** of up to **36 months** can be bought separately, but only within **90 days** of the original purchase. |\n| **AquaFlow AF‑300** (countertop beverage brewer) | **24 months** limited warranty from date of purchase | Manufacturing defects under normal household use | – Consumable wear and misuse are excluded. |\n| **SkyBrew Coffee Maker** (model SB‑450) | **24 months** from date of purchase | Defects in materials and workmanship (manufacturing defects only) | – Coverage does not extend to damage caused by unauthorized repairs, misuse, or normal wear and tear such as descaling deposits. |\n\n**Summary**\n\n- The AF‑200 offers the shortest base warranty (12 months) but provides an optional extended warranty up to 36 months if purchased within 90 days.  \n- Both the AF‑300 and the SkyBrew Coffee Maker provide a 24‑month limited warranty.  \n- All three warranties exclude damage from unauthorized repairs and misuse; the AF‑200 also excludes improper installation and use with non‑water fluids, while the SkyBrew excludes normal wear‑and‑tear (e.g., descaling deposits) and the AF‑300 excludes consumable wear.  \n\nThese points are drawn directly from the warranty sections of the AquaFlow AF‑200 Manual, AquaFlow AF‑300 Manual, and the SkyBrew Coffee Maker manual (sample_manual.pdf).", "sources": 7, "duration_ms": 29584, "budget": {"max_agent_iterations": 3, "max_llm_calls": 3, "max_retrieval_operations": 2, "max_guardrail_retries": 1, "agent_iterations": 1, "llm_calls": 3, "retrieval_operations": 1, "guardrail_retries": 0}, "request_id": "f2741914", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
