{"ts": "2026-09-28 12:54:53", "level": "INFO", "event": "chat.qa", "question": "compare them with specs please", "answer": "**Specification comparison (based on the indexed manuals)**  \n\n| Specification | AquaFlow AF‑200 (submersible pump) | AquaFlow AF‑300 (countertop beverage brewer) | SkyBrew Coffee Maker (model SB‑450) |\n|---------------|------------------------------------|----------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------|\n| **Model** | AquaFlow AF‑200 | AquaFlow AF‑300 | SkyBrew SB‑450 |\n| **Primary function** | Submersible water pump | Countertop beverage brewer (3 brew modes) | Automatic drip coffee maker with built‑in grinder |\n| **Power rating / consumption** | 750 W | 1450 W | *Not specified in the provided manual* |\n| **Voltage / frequency** | 230 V AC, 50 Hz | *Not specified* | *Not specified* |\n| **Flow / capacity** | Max flow rate: 200 L/min | Reservoir capacity: 1.8 L (removable tank) | *Not specified* |\n| **Pressure / head** | Max head height: 8 m | *Not applicable* | *Not specified* |\n| **Temperature limits** | Max water temperature: 35 °C | Heating range: 92–96 °C (brew temperature) | *Not specified* |\n| **Physical dimensions / weight** | Weight: 6.2 kg; housing: stainless steel & reinforced polymer; cable length: 10 m | *Not specified* | *Not specified* |\n| **Key materials** | Stainless steel & reinforced polymer housing | Reusable stainless‑steel mesh filter; 1.8 L reservoir | *Not specified* |\n| **Warranty** | 12 months limited (extendable to 36 months if purchased within 90 days) | 24 months limited warranty | 24 months limited warranty (manufacturing defects only) |\n| **Additional features / notes** | Must stay fully submerged; dry‑run damages seals; not for pools or flammable liquids | Three brew modes (Classic, Strong, Quick); descaling recommended when mineral buildup appears | Supports drip brewing, programmable timer, built‑in grinder; descaling every 60 brew cycles with vinegar/water or 