{"ts": "2026-09-28 13:02:54", "level": "INFO", "event": "chat.qa", "question": "how i can take leave?", "answer": "To take leave, you must submit a leave request through the HR portal at least 5 working days in advance. The policy outlines the following leave entitlements:\n\n- **Annual leave:** 18 paid days per calendar year, accrued monthly at 1.5 days; up to 5 unused days may be carried over with manager approval.  \n- **Sick leave:** 10 paid days per year; a medical certificate is required for absences exceeding 2 consecutive days, and sick leave does not carry over.  \n\nFollow the appropriate leave type’s requirements (e.g., provide a medical certificate for sick leave if needed) and submit your request via the HR portal with the required notice period.", "sources": 1, "duration_ms": 32325, "budget": {"max_agent_iterations": 3, "max_llm_calls": 3, "max_retrieval_operations": 2, "max_guardrail_retries": 1, "agent_iterations": 1, "llm_calls": 3, "retrieval_operations": 1, "guardrail_retries": 0}, "request_id": "b969bc58", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
