{"ts": "2026-09-28 13:05:35", "level": "INFO", "event": "chat.qa", "question": "relieving process for employee", "answer": "The employee handbook outlines the relieving (termination/resignation) process as follows:\n\n- **Resignation:** An employee who wishes to resign must submit written notice of at least 30 days.  \n- **Company‑initiated termination:** The company may terminate employment for cause without notice, or without cause subject to statutory notice periods and any applicable severance pay.  \n\nThese are the relieving‑process provisions stated in the policy document.", "sources": 1, "duration_ms": 21514, "budget": {"max_agent_iterations": 3, "max_llm_calls": 3, "max_retrieval_operations": 2, "max_guardrail_retries": 1, "agent_iterations": 1, "llm_calls": 3, "retrieval_operations": 1, "guardrail_retries": 0}, "request_id": "c2003377", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
