{"ts": "2026-09-28 13:12:43", "level": "DEBUG", "event": "llm.context_sent", "status": "success", "chunks": [{"parent_id": "2ca8704b-e0ee-452b-9c49-42e290c9c0d4", "text": "AquaFlow AF-300\nCountertop Beverage Brewer — Product Manual\nSYNTHETIC TEST DOCUMENT — created for RAG evaluation; not a real person or commercial\nproduct.\nOverview\nThe AquaFlow AF-300 is a countertop beverage brewer with three brew modes and a removable 1.8-litre\nreservoir.\nSafety\nPlace the brewer on a stable, dry surface. Do not operate with an empty reservoir. Allow the heating plate\nto cool before cleaning.\nOperation\nFill the reservoir, insert the filter, select a brew mode, and press Start. Quick mode is intended for smaller\nservings.\nMaintenance\nRinse the reusable filter after each use. Descale periodically when mineral buildup is visible or brewing\nperformance declines.\nTroubleshooting\nIf brewing stops, verify the reservoir is seated correctly and contains sufficient water. If the unit does not\nheat, disconnect power and contact authorized service.\nWarranty\nThe AF-300 includes a 24-month limited warranty covering manufacturing defects under normal\nhousehold use. Consumable wear and misuse are excluded.\nSpecification\nValue\nModel\nAquaFlow AF-300\nCapacity\n1.8 litres\nHeating range\n92–96 °C\nBrew modes\nClassic, Strong, Quick\nReservoir\n1.8 L removable tank\nFilter\nReusable stainless-steel mesh\nPower\n1450 W\nWarranty\n24 months limited warranty"}], "request_id": "1bb0fca7", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
