{"ts": "2026-09-28 13:14:10", "level": "INFO", "event": "chat.qa", "question": "both", "answer": "**Priya Nandakumar**  \n- **Role:** Mechanical Design Engineer  \n- **Experience:**  \n  - Senior Design Engineer, Meridian Fluid Systems Pvt. Ltd. (2021‑Present) – led mechanical design of a submersible pump product line, reduced impeller cavitation failures by 34% via revised blade geometry, coordinated warranty‑return analysis and seal‑degradation root‑cause fixes.  \n  - Design Engineer, HomeTech Appliances Ltd. (2018‑2021) – designed housings and thermal‑management systems for small kitchen appliances (coffee makers, kettles), owned DFMEA documentation, supported UL/CE certification testing for two product launches.  \n- **Education:** B.Tech in Mechanical Engineering, Indian Institute of Technology, Guwahati (2014‑2018)  \n- **Skills:** SolidWorks, ANSYS Fluent, GD&T, DFMEA, injection‑molding design, pump hydraulics, thermal analysis, supplier PPAP review  \n- **Certifications:** Certified SolidWorks Professional (CSWP), Six Sigma Green Belt  \n\n**Priya Rajesh**  \n- **Role:** AI Engineer  \n- **Experience:**  \n  - AI Engineer, Nexa Intelligence Labs (2023‑2026)  \n  - Machine Learning Engineer, BlueOrbit Systems (2021‑2023)  \n  - Selected work: designed a hybrid lexical‑vector retrieval document QA service; built evaluation datasets for entity resolution, ambiguity handling, and conversational reference resolution; developed Python services for ingestion, chunking, metadata tracking, and retrieval diagnostics; worked with local language models and tool‑using agent workflows.  \n- **Technical Skills:** Python, SQL, LangGraph, LangChain, vector search, BM25, retrieval‑augmented generation, NLP, machine learning, document processing, evaluation, REST APIs, Flask  \n- **Education:** M.Tech. in Artificial Intelligence, South Coast Institute of Technology (2021)  \n- **Additional Information:** Primary interests include trustworthy AI systems, retrieval quality, agent evaluation, and human‑centered AI applications.", "sources": 2, "duration_ms": 30684, "budget": {"max_agent_iterations": 3, "max_llm_calls": 3, "max_retrieval_operations": 2, "max_guardrail_retries": 1, "agent_iterations": 1, "llm_calls": 3, "retrieval_operations": 1, "guardrail_retries": 0}, "request_id": "f0a26d25", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
