{"ts": "2026-09-28 13:15:18", "level": "INFO", "event": "chat.qa", "question": "compare their skills please", "answer": "**Priya Nandakumar – Skills (from candidate_resume.pdf)**  \n- SolidWorks, ANSYS Fluent, GD&T, DFMEA  \n- Injection‑molding design, pump hydraulics, thermal analysis  \n- Supplier PPAP review  \n- Certifications: Certified SolidWorks Professional (CSWP), Six Sigma Green Belt  \n\n**Priya Rajesh – Skills (from Priya_Rajesh_AI_Engineer.pdf)**  \n- Python, SQL, LangGraph, LangChain  \n- Vector search, BM25, retrieval‑augmented generation, NLP, machine learning  \n- Document processing, evaluation, REST APIs, Flask  \n- Experience with local language models and tool‑using agent workflows  \n\n**Comparison**  \n- **Domain focus:** Priya Nandakumar’s skill set centers on mechanical design, fluid‑systems engineering, and manufacturing‑related tools (CAD, simulation, GD&T, DFMEA). Priya Rajesh’s skill set is oriented toward software/AI engineering, emphasizing programming languages, retrieval‑augmented generation, vector search, and API‑based services.  \n- **Technical tools:** Nandakumar uses engineering‑specific software (SolidWorks, ANSYS Fluent) and quality‑engineering methods (DFMEA, PPAP). Rajesh uses data‑science and ML frameworks (Python, SQL, LangGraph/LangChain, BM25, REST/Flask).  \n- **Certifications vs. project experience:** Nandakumar lists formal certifications (CSWP, Six Sigma Green Belt). Rajesh highlights project‑based accomplishments (designing a hybrid QA service, building evaluation datasets, developing Python services for ingestion/chunking).  \n- **Overlap:** Both demonstrate strong analytical and problem‑solving abilities, but they apply them in different technical realms—hardware‑focused mechanical design versus software‑focused AI/retrieval systems.  \n\nThus, Priya Nandakumar’s skills are rooted in mechanical design and manufacturing engineering, while Priya Rajesh’s skills are rooted in AI/ML engineering and document‑processing pipelines.", "sources": 2, "duration_ms": 22981, "budget": {"max_agent_iterations": 3, "max_llm_calls": 3, "max_retrieval_operations": 2, "max_guardrail_retries": 1, "agent_iterations": 1, "llm_calls": 3, "retrieval_operations": 1, "guardrail_retries": 0}, "request_id": "3105faf9", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
