{"ts": "2026-09-28 13:28:54", "level": "INFO", "event": "chat.qa", "question": "af200", "answer": "SkyBrew is covered by a **24‑month** warranty from the date of purchase.  \n\nThe AquaFlow AF‑200 manual states that the pump comes with a **limited warranty of 12 months** from the date of purchase, and that an **extended warranty of up to 36 months** can be purchased separately within 90 days of the original purchase.  \n\n**Comparison**\n\n| Product | Standard warranty period | Optional extended warranty |\n|---------|--------------------------|----------------------------|\n| SkyBrew | 24 months | – (not mentioned) |\n| AquaFlow AF‑200 | 12 months | Up to 36 months (available for purchase) |\n\nThus, SkyBrew’s standard coverage is longer than the AquaFlow AF‑200’s base warranty, while AquaFlow offers the possibility to extend coverage beyond SkyBrew’s 24‑month period if the optional extended warranty is purchased.", "sources": 4, "duration_ms": 161010, "budget": {"max_agent_iterations": 3, "max_llm_calls": 3, "max_retrieval_operations": 2, "max_guardrail_retries": 1, "agent_iterations": 1, "llm_calls": 3, "retrieval_operations": 1, "guardrail_retries": 0}, "request_id": "2d56a1f8", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
