{"ts": "2026-09-28 13:32:06", "level": "INFO", "event": "chat.qa", "question": "compare them with af300 coverage?", "answer": "The AquaFlow AF‑200 comes with a **12‑month limited warranty** from the date of purchase, with an optional **extended warranty of up to 36 months** available for separate purchase within 90 days of the original purchase.\n\nThe AquaFlow AF‑300 includes a **24‑month limited warranty** covering manufacturing defects under normal household use; the manual does not mention any optional extended warranty for the AF‑300.\n\n**Comparison**\n\n| Model | Standard warranty period | Optional extended warranty |\n|-------|--------------------------|----------------------------|\n| AquaFlow AF‑200 | 12 months | Up to 36 months (available for purchase) |\n| AquaFlow AF‑300 | 24 months | Not mentioned (no optional extension noted) |\n\nThus, the AF‑300 offers a longer standard warranty period than the AF‑200, while the AF‑200 can be extended beyond the AF‑300’s standard period if the optional extended warranty is purchased.", "sources": 4, "duration_ms": 27124, "budget": {"max_agent_iterations": 3, "max_llm_calls": 3, "max_retrieval_operations": 2, "max_guardrail_retries": 1, "agent_iterations": 1, "llm_calls": 3, "retrieval_operations": 1, "guardrail_retries": 0}, "request_id": "ebb0334a", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
