{"ts": "2026-09-28 13:34:49", "level": "INFO", "event": "chat.qa", "question": "what about patient complaints?", "answer": "According to the hospital intake procedures, patients have the right to lodge complaints about care quality through the Patient Relations office. Complaints are acknowledged within 48 hours and are investigated within 15 working days. Patients also retain the right to access their medical records and request a second opinion.", "sources": 1, "duration_ms": 19553, "budget": {"max_agent_iterations": 3, "max_llm_calls": 3, "max_retrieval_operations": 2, "max_guardrail_retries": 1, "agent_iterations": 1, "llm_calls": 3, "retrieval_operations": 1, "guardrail_retries": 0}, "request_id": "4e6777ce", "session_id": "46123eeefca7"}
